1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,160
Thrifting is inherently hit or miss you can find something really cute something that is a holy grail item.
淘旧衣本来就有好有坏：你可能找到特别可爱、像梦中宝物一样的单品。

2
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,480
That makes you very excited to find.
找到它会让你特别兴奋。

3
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:13,599
Or you can find nothing you can keep searching and searching and not find one good thing.
也可能什么都没找到；你一直找啊找，却连一件好东西都没有。

4
00:00:13,599 --> 00:00:18,880
And it can suck a lot which becomes exponentially more the case when you're plus size.
这真的很糟糕，而当你穿大码时，这种情况在她看来会更加严重。

5
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,439
And I have been told time and time again usually by people who are thinner than me that thrifting while plus size is really easy.
别人一次又一次告诉我，通常还是比我瘦的人，说穿大码淘衣其实很容易。

6
00:00:25,439 --> 00:00:30,720
That there's a ton of cute plus size options and that this is a non issue.
他们说有很多可爱的大码选择，这根本不算问题。

7
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:35,520
Which is really interesting because I'm talking about my personal experience as a plus sized woman.
这很有意思，因为我说的明明是自己作为大码女性的亲身经历。

8
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,399
And I'm sure a lot of other plus sized people relate.
我相信很多其他大码人士也有同感。

9
00:00:38,399 --> 00:00:44,879
That it's just not easy to find clothes that fit you yet alone clothes that fit you that you actually want to wear.
找到合身的衣服已经不容易，更别提既合身又真正想穿的衣服了。

10
00:00:44,879 --> 00:00:48,480
I was partially inspired to make this video because of this tik tok I made.
我拍这个视频，部分灵感来自自己之前发的一条 TikTok。

11
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:55,440
And I was inspired to make that video because of how often I've been told that it's really easy to find cute plus siz clothes while thrifting.
我之所以做那条视频，是因为别人经常告诉我，淘旧衣时很容易找到可爱的大码衣服。

12
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:56,800
And it's just really not.
可对我来说，事实真的不是这样。

13
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:00,960
As someone who is an avid thrifter and has been thrifting since I was a child.
我很喜欢淘衣，从小就开始逛旧衣店了。

14
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:06,880
I do think it has become more difficult in the past few years to find cute plus siz clothes at thrift stores.
我确实觉得，过去几年里，在旧衣店找到可爱的大码衣服变得更难了。

15
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:09,200
And there's a lot of different factors that could be causing that.
可能有很多不同因素造成了这种情况。

16
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:16,479
I think thrifting has become more popular resellers have become more popular where maybe plus siz people are holding on to their clothes more.
我觉得淘衣更流行了，转售者也更多了；也许大码人士会把自己的衣服留得更久。

17
00:01:16,479 --> 00:01:22,320
Because it's harder to find cute plus siz clothes that you like and I'm on the smaller end of plus size.
因为很难找到自己喜欢的大码衣服。而我还属于大码范围里较小的一端。

18
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:28,720
I am an 1820 so it only gets more difficult to find those cute clothes the larger the size you are.
我的尺码大约是18到20码；尺码越大，找到可爱衣服就越难。

19
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,720
But I'm not here to speculate on the reasons.
不过我不是来猜测原因的。

20
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:38,799
I'm sure there are many different factors at play that make finding plus siz clothes you actually want to wear at the thrift store very difficult.
我相信有很多因素共同作用，让人在旧衣店找到真正想穿的大码衣服变得很难。

21
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:48,640
Instead I'm here to take you all thrifting with me and show you the reality of thrifting as a plus siz person.
所以我今天要带大家一起淘衣，展示作为大码人士淘衣的真实经历。

22
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:54,310
I have really been on the hunt for good summer tops because I've realized that I don't have enough tops.
我一直在找好看的夏季上衣，因为我发现自己的上衣还不够。

23
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:59,190
That are flowy keep me cool are natural fiber but as you can see.
我想找飘逸、凉快、天然纤维的款式；不过，正如你看到的……

24
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:04,960
There were just a lot of not good shirts I couldn't tell if this one was kind of cute.
这里好多衬衫都不怎么样；这一件我也拿不准是不是好看。

25
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:09,119
But my rule is that if I'm not sure about something then I just keep going.
但我的原则是：如果拿不准，就继续逛。

26
00:02:09,119 --> 00:02:12,480
Because I don't want to have a wardrobe full of stuff that I'm not sure about.
因为我不想让衣柜里装满自己拿不准是否喜欢的衣服。

27
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:17,760
I love thrifting okay I love searching the hunt the thrill of finding a really good piece.
我喜欢淘衣，喜欢找寻、搜罗，以及找到好单品的那种兴奋。

28
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:26,560
But it just sucks when there are so many pieces and then there's like maybe 15 20 pieces if you're lucky in the plus size section and none of them are good.
可当店里衣服很多，大码区运气好却只有十五到二十件，而且没有一件好看时，真的很失望。

29
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:33,120
I think this location might have been moving inventory or restocking because there were like no dresses in any size.
我觉得这家店可能在搬库存或补货，因为几乎所有尺码都没有连衣裙。

30
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:38,000
I kind of had a feeling at this point that this thrift store was a bust and I wasn't going to find anything.
到这会儿，我有种预感：这家旧衣店要空手而归了，估计找不到什么。

31
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:46,400
But I had to keep going I had to keep searching you know I don't give up that easily even though maybe sometimes I should.
但我还得继续找；我没那么容易放弃，虽然可能有时真该放弃。

32
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:50,160
I didn't find one cute thing and I just got rain water in my shoe.
一件好看的都没找到，雨水还进了我的鞋里。

33
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:52,160
Okay that was a bust I didn't find anything.
好了，这次完全没收获，什么都没找到。

34
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:57,440
Which I wasn't super expecting to just because usually when I come to this thrift store I don't find much.
其实我原本也没抱太大期待，因为平常来这家旧衣店就找不到多少东西。

35
00:02:57,440 --> 00:03:03,840
But also I've been in such a thrifting rut that like at no thrift store do I really find much.
而且最近淘衣一直不顺，感觉无论去哪家店都淘不到什么。

36
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:12,239
Anyways I obviously do not give up that easily so we're going to go to another thrift store and see if they have anything anything at all.
不过我当然不会这么容易放弃，所以再去一家旧衣店，看有没有什么，哪怕一点也好。

37
00:03:12,239 --> 00:03:17,440
Also really quick I know in my thrift with me videos I usually give a list of stuff that I'm looking for.
顺便说一下，我平常在陪我淘衣的视频里，会列出自己正在找的东西。

38
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,440
But this time I'm just trying to be open about it.
但这次我想保持开放，不把目标限定得太死。

39
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:24,959
I am generally looking for spring and summer clothes but I'm trying not to be too specific about it.
总体上我在找春夏衣服，但不想把要求说得过于具体。

40
00:03:24,959 --> 00:03:28,560
Because a lot of times when I'm very specific about it I don't find anything.
因为很多时候，我的目标越具体，反而越找不到东西。

41
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:33,920
So I'm trying to have a more laxed like if it's meant to be it'll come to me attitude.
所以我想更放松一点，抱着如果命中注定，东西自然会来到我面前的心态。

42
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:40,500
I kind of sounded like a frog just then okay we're here wish me luck.
我刚才听起来有点像青蛙。好了，我们到了，祝我好运吧。
